urname>Soejima</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsubara</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tasaka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kikuchi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kobayashi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ikeda</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Sadick</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hebert</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Aikawa</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kanazawa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamaguchi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Importance of interleukin-8 in the development of reexpansion lung injury in rabbits</article-title><source>Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>161</volume><fpage>1030</fpage><lpage>1036</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10712359</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>